{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264/events","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/22264","id":219147025,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyMTkxNDcwMjU=","number":22264,"title":"[Monolog Bridge] ChromeHeadless ChromePHPLogger support","user":{"login":"redthor","id":767896,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2Nzg5Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/767896?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor","html_url":"https://github.com/redthor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/redthor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":100079,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAwNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null},{"id":95674534,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTY3NDUzNA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/MonologBridge","name":"MonologBridge","color":"DDDDDD","default":false,"description":null},{"id":237003792,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzcwMDM3OTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Review","name":"Status: Needs Review","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2017-04-04T05:52:45Z","updated_at":"2017-04-05T13:45:21Z","closed_at":"2017-04-05T13:45:21Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"| Q                | A\r\n| ---------------- | -----\r\n| Bug report?      | yes\r\n| Feature request? | no\r\n| BC Break report? | no\r\n| RFC?             | no\r\n| Symfony version  | 3.2\r\n\r\nI have logged https://github.com/Seldaek/monolog/pull/966 about getting Chromium 57 user agent string support. Unfortunately the regex is overridden by the bridge in the child class.\r\n\r\nI can change the Symfony Monolog Bridge like so:\r\n```diff --git a/src/Symfony/Bridge/Monolog/Handler/ChromePhpHandler.php b/src/Symfony/Bridge/Monolog/Handler/ChromePhpHandler.php\r\nindex 2636bc3..1f99552 100644\r\n--- a/src/Symfony/Bridge/Monolog/Handler/ChromePhpHandler.php\r\n+++ b/src/Symfony/Bridge/Monolog/Handler/ChromePhpHandler.php\r\n@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ class ChromePhpHandler extends BaseChromePhpHandler\r\n             return;\r\n         }\r\n \r\n-        if (!preg_match('{\\b(?:Chrome/\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)*|Firefox/(?:4[3-9]|[5-9]\\d|\\d{3,})(?:\\.\\d)*)\\b}', $event->getRequest()->headers->get('User-Agent'))) {\r\n+        if (!preg_match(self::USER_AGENT_REGEX, $event->getRequest()->headers->get('User-Agent'))) {\r\n             $this->sendHeaders = false;\r\n             $this->headers = array();\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever to get this patch to work I'd also need to bump the monolog minimum version from `~1.11` to  `~1.19.0` (April 2016) to get the `self::USER_AGENT_REGEX` const in the parent class.\r\n\r\nOtherwise I have to repeat that same change here as https://github.com/Seldaek/monolog/pull/966\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"fabpot","id":47313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot","html_url":"https://github.com/fabpot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabpot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/22264/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}